Precision Validator

This distribution contains validation and integration code, not the Slime,
Megatron-LM, PyTorch, Transformer Engine, or Flash Linear Attention projects.
Those projects remain separately installed dependencies with their own licenses.

The Slime bridge installer recognizes small source boundaries in the external
Slime training entry and modifies only a newly created copy. Slime is distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0: https://github.com/THUDM/slime.

Model weights, training datasets, vendor runtime images, cluster configuration,
credentials, and historical raw training tensors are not part of this repository.
